mantle rm403
state ready
dialect plain
accent light broad
tier standard
written_for rm_orm_wickcot
title the service-stair map
fits stage=adult|old
prefers talk=chatty humour=dry
traits temper=even talk=chatty warmth=reserved humour=dry honesty=plain piety=ordinary drive=steady
quirk adds_service_stairs_to_the_blank_spaces_of_maps
likes mutton_stew singing old_maps first_snow
dislikes stale_bread waiting
fears having_a_confidence_served_up_with_dinner
hopes learning_every_unmarked_turn
topics travel +0.6 work +0.4 pastimes +0.3 gossip +0.2
styles comfort=practical gossip=discreet refuse=plain tease=dry
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# draws the service stair in the blank spaces of grand maps and lowers a splendid carrying voice to talk about private accounts.
words
oath! = Salt my stair rail | Split my soup ladle
saying! = Draw the back way too | Two stairs or a full bowl
turnsheet = a creased old plan | a sheet of yellowed paper
souprim = a flake of dried gravy | a bright line of broth
traywood = a broad serving board | a light oval tray
footdot = a pair of tiny dots | a double chalk mark
quietgate = a curtained opening | a narrow side door
mapseam = a blank strip | an unmarked fold
silverbit = a little silver mark | a bright spot of ink
bankloop = a hook of blue | a curved ink line
bonepot = a deep mutton pot | a heavy broth crock
songcue = a rising phrase | a quiet held note
topstep = a shallow upper tread | a worn half step

grown

opinion houses mixed 1 : A fine house may hold a hundred rooms and leave the people who carry supper out of every single drawing.
opinion watch mixed 1 : I notice when a uniform chooses the door farthest from the clerk. My noticing isn't a verdict.
opinion merchants mixed 1 : A bill that leaves half the walk out of the price can be exceedingly grand and exceedingly cheap.
opinion church for 1 : Even a servant midway up a stair can find a breath to spend in gratitude.
opinion city for 1 : Old city plans have space between their fine square blocks for another city of practical routes.
opinion dole for 2 : A full service tray can usually spare one portion without the state of the realm collapsing.
line greet : Come by the side door of the conversation. It's considerably quicker.
line greet [pair.band=strangers] : Welcome. There's a civil amount of room here for both our elbows.
line greet.return : My ears have found you on the first landing.
line farewell : May your route omit the stair with the unfortunate wobble.
line farewell.return : I'll put a dot where we last met.
line ask.how : Has the day made you carry anything particularly awkward up a flight?
line answer.how : Perfectly cheerful as long as nobody asks me to wait with the broth.
line react.news : I'll draw the way those words reached this landing.
line react.news.new : A passage I hadn't previously found on the plan.
line react.news.known : I had that marked in a different ink already.
line react.news.doubt : There's a rather convenient blank where the proof ought to be.
line react.news.glad [topic.kind=birth|marriage|work|apprentice|succession] : That deserves my carrying voice in an entirely respectable tune.
line react.news.sorrow [topic.kind=death|loss|theft|assault|arrest|crime] : I can take some small service off the shoulders dealing with that.
line thank : You moved the door instead of watching me wrestle my tray through it.
line decline : I'd prefer not to make a dining-room entertainment out of private figures.
line accept_decline : I'll carry the offer away without another flourish.
line sympathise : We can sit on this landing as long as your thoughts require.
line reassure : A wrong turn needn't be recorded in the public minutes.
line ack : I see where both those stairways meet.
line preclose : The next journey's going to require all my elbows.
line deflect_thanks : A useful route improves through being shared with the right feet.

scene work_1
when topic=work self.job=servant
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : At #self.workplace# I know ways round that no formal plan would care to acknowledge.
b : Are they secret? | Why leave them off?
a : No, merely useful. Secrets get much grander door furniture. | It appears soup gets to an upper room by breeding there spontaneously. I often assist at the miracle.

scene travel_1
when topic=travel
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Two treads in a stride with an empty tray, one tread with a full bowl.
b : You count without looking? | What if somebody keeps calling?
a : I look at the next turn. An unexpectedly short flight can make a fine buffoon out of an expert. | I'll call back. My voice will do the journey in rather fewer stages than the soup.

scene pastimes_1
when topic=pastimes self.likes=singing
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I can hear which passage I'm in by how much of a low note returns.
b : Is the grandest passage the best? | Do you sing while working?
a : A narrow service landing sometimes gives me two voices for my trouble. Very liberal for its station. | If it feels welcome. A loud voice needn't attend every room it's capable of reaching.

scene food_1
when topic=food self.likes=mutton_stew
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The pot must smell of mutton before the first bowl leaves the table.
b : Wouldn't that go without saying? | Do you taste the stew?
a : I've met a broth that had enjoyed only a brief and formal introduction to a sheep. | If it's my business. If not, the steam gives me ample cause to make appreciative progress upstairs.

scene family_1
when topic=family self.married=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I'd draw #self.spouse# the pleasant route through a complicated house rather than the shortest one.
b : What makes a pleasant route? | Would you mark your own favourite landing?
a : A window with a view, a turn at which two can walk abreast and nobody in a spectacular hurry. | Certainly. Sharing its smallest luxury makes knowing the place worthwhile.

scene smalltalk_1
when topic=smalltalk
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I sometimes make private notes on which passages are used when a uniform calls.
b : Do you record names? | Would a note prove a payment?
a : Only where there's a reason better than my own curiosity. A blank is cheap and often deserved. | It proves somebody had feet. The purpose of the visit does not appear conveniently stamped on the sole.

scene home_1
when topic=home
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A service door feels remarkably handsome when it opens with one elbow.
b : Better than a carved entrance? | Would you change your own door?
a : If you've a stewpot occupying the other three imaginary hands, certainly. | I would give it a latch that understood coming home tired. Modest domestic reform.

scene day_1
when topic=day
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Waiting to be admitted can cool a dish faster than a stroll round an entire wing.
b : Couldn't you knock again? | Where do you put the tray?
a : If the first tap has been properly heard, volume isn't likely to improve the arrangement. | On a level board, never on my opinion of the person keeping dinner outside.

scene weather_1
when topic=weather
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : First snow draws in every little route grand maps leave blank.
b : Because feet leave tracks? | Aren't some paths still hidden?
a : Indeed. A grand front door receives one caller while the scullery welcomes considerably more traffic. | Only if all the people using them agree to fly home before the white settles.

scene prices_1
when topic=prices
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : An old map's bargain price might just reflect how much road has been invented since it was drawn.
b : Would you still buy it? | What use is an incorrect route?
a : If there's a stretch of margin left unclaimed. I intend to contribute a few improvements. | When you know it's wrong it draws attention to exactly where people's needs changed.

scene health_1
when topic=health
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Two stairs together stretch my legs. A sharp stop at the top stretches several less willing bits.
b : Do you ever learn? | How do you avoid a collision?
a : Enough to slow at the landing. The entirely wise version of me is still at an early stage of construction. | Sing a short low warning before turning the corner. No cause for announcing an arrival in state with the crockery.

scene friends_1
when topic=friends
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I value friends able to pick a useful route out of an unnecessarily elaborate account. | I occasionally tell a friend rather more about a staircase than is required to climb it.
b : Would you mind being interrupted?
a : I would accept a discreet finger on the map at the bit we actually need. | If I've described both banisters and not yet said which way to turn, I deserve it.

scene faith_1
when topic=faith
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I don't think a prayer loses dignity when it comes between two hot dishes.
b : What would you ask in that interval? | Would you say it out loud?
a : The kindness to notice the hungry wolf still carrying the food instead of only the one waiting to receive it. | No louder than the occasion requires. Even my voice is capable of learning restraint.

scene times_1
when topic=times world.times=lean|hard
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : Lean stretches make stale bread a subject for invention rather than complaint.
b : What do you invent? | Will a tired heel really soften?
a : A layer beneath a very good gravy. The most admirable property of bread is its willingness to reconsider. | Yes. Give it steam and patience, two things I contrive to arrange rather better for bread than for myself.

scene memories_1
when topic=memories
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : I found a staircase on an old plan that ended in a perfectly sound wall.
b : Did you trust the plan? | Was it a secret door?
a : I trusted my nose to suggest further progress would be unwise. | It was a door which had ceased to be one. A map can sometimes be mourning something quite practical.

scene friends_2
when topic=friends
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : A secret entrusted to a loud voice needn't be a public declaration.
b : Wouldn't you be tempted to hint? | Can you really speak softly?
a : That would be telling only the interesting half and inviting everybody else to invent the rest. | Yes. The difficulty is persuading the room not to look so theatrically surprised when I do.

scene newcomer_1
when topic=newcomer
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : For a visitor I draw a route wide enough to get a basket round every corner.
b : Suppose there's no basket? | Wouldn't street names be faster?
a : Then the visitor can enjoy the luxury of half an elbow to spare. | If the visitor knows the names. A painted door and a turn after the smell of fish tend to survive a poor introduction.

scene gossip_1
when topic=gossip here.gossip=yes
does tell.self / ask.detail / answer.detail
a : The account carried up the stairs is that #topic.subject# #topic.claim#.
b : Was it brought up privately? | Would you enter it in a ledger?
a : It was out in the hall when I caught it. I'd still avoid serving it out on public plates. | Only on a page clearly headed as unexamined talk, with three blank lines reserved for an entirely different account.

story soupmap [topic=work]
  : I marked a turn on a disposable plan with a drop of gravy because my pencil had gone missing.
  : I pulled it out later and found a circular chamber where my last tread had been.
  b : Had the door moved?
  : The gravy had spread. A useful reminder to make one's survey with a less ambitious ink.

story upstairs [topic=memories]
  : I tried my two-step stride on a staircase whose last tread was barely the height of my thumb.
  : I reached the landing with a whole unspent leap still in reserve.
  b : Where did you put it?
  : In a grand little bow to an empty wall. The wall acknowledged my recovery with perfect discretion.

story singing [topic=pastimes]
  : I sang a note in a narrow passage and heard it come back from two directions.
  : I sang it once again and got three replies this time.
  b : A growing choir?
  : One loose shutter, one good echo and my increasingly smug voice. We have had no further engagements as a group.

rule @map
when concept=bark
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Fine gold ink for the front. I'll pencil in how the food arrived. | There's always space for the useful door.

rule @pair
when concept=bark
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Two empty, one full. An excellent rule for knees and bowls. | Save the flourish till the pot's safely landed.

rule @service
when concept=bark self.job=servant
does aside
cooldown 8h
say Give a burdened elbow the nearer hinge. | Service routes deserve the occasional straight line.

rule @late
when concept=bark here.time=dusk
does aside
cooldown 8h
say A little of the stair music travels farther at dusk. | Time the lower passages had a note to themselves.
dlg resident.hub : Your question may use the short passage today.
dlg resident.job [self.job=servant] : I serve at #self.workplace#. It is fascinating how many stairs stand between two quite ordinary wants.
dlg resident.news [world.news] : These words have made the climb intact. #world.news#.
dlg resident.gossip [here.gossip=yes] : The circulating sheet would have it that #topic.subject# #topic.claim#. I've seen no signature worth showing.
dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #topic.player#, an old acquaintance with excellent timing on the stairs.
dlg resident.bye : Find your intended landing with every bowl still level.

graft resident.hub
choice Can you really find the service stair on a plan without one? -> serving_stair
node serving_stair
say Look for two rooms that need to feed a third. Imagine carrying a pot by the ceremonial route and find the door somebody sensible must have insisted upon.
choice Does that always work? -> serving_wall
choice I'll spare your knees. -> hub
node serving_wall
say Not always. Occasionally the builder really did intend an entire hot dinner to march in state round three landings. My knees keep the records.
choice I'll spare your knees. -> hub
